# fresh_dev_suspend_pause_then_resume: A paused device given a blob: rvg_device_will_resume and rvg_device_did_resume on it. pause left the FIFOs quiesced and the guest display paused; rvg_device_did_resume's root-page write tears the FIFOs down and clears the enable mark, so no FIFO is rebuilt and the NOP is not answered; the display is restored, and the guest display is no longer paused (rvg_display_cursor_position, whose GuestDisplay::cursor_position dies on a paused guest display, reads it).
